<title>USA: Leggett &amp; Platt acquires four businesses.</title>
<headline>Leggett &amp; Platt acquires four businesses.</headline>
<dateline>CARTHAGE, Mo. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leggett &amp; Platt Inc said Thursday it recently acquired four businesses that will add a total of $80 million to its annual sales.</p>
<p>It said two of the acquired businesses, Amco Corp and Rodgers-Wade Manufacturing Co, make commercial fixtures and displays. The other two, Latrobe Plastics Co and Airo Die Casting, make aluminum die castings.</p>
<p>Leggett &amp; Platt makes engineered products for furnishings and specialty industrial markets. It has annual sales of $2.4 billion.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
